  "description": "Defocusing NLS — the regime where the nonlinearity opposes localization. Solitons spread rather than compress. The dark soliton is a notch in a background field, an absence rather than a presence. High dispersion, negative polarity. The water table beneath the foundation, always there, always moving away.",
